{%- comment -%}
  ============================================================================
  Snippet: Global account popup (sign in / create account)
  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Modal popup with the sign-in card (snippets/global-account-forms.liquid).
  Rendered once per page by layout/theme.liquid, only for signed-out
  shoppers (and never on the account pages themselves).

  Opens when the shopper:
  - taps ♡ on a product card while the wishlist needs an account
    (assets/global-product-card.js → window.NNAccount.open)
  - clicks the header wishlist / account link, or the "Sign in" buttons on
    the wishlist page (any element with data-account-open="login|register")
  - lands on the wishlist page while signed out (data-account-autoopen)

  Desktop: centered card that scales in over a blurred backdrop.
  Phones:  sheet that slides up from the bottom.
  Closes with ✕, Escape or a click on the backdrop.

  Used in:  layout/theme.liquid
  CSS:      assets/global-account.css → "Popup" (classes .account-popup*)
  JS:       assets/global-account.js (window.NNAccount)
  ============================================================================
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="account-popup" data-account-popup hidden>
  {%- comment -%} Backdrop: click closes {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="account-popup__scrim" data-account-close></div>

  <div
    class="account-popup__dialog"
    role="dialog"
    aria-modal="true"
    aria-label="{{ 'customer.popup.label' | t }}"
    tabindex="-1"
    data-account-dialog
  >
    {% render 'global-account-forms', context: 'popup', view: 'login' %}
  </div>
</div>
